    "%lld 条资料仍在整理": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld sources still processing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 在资料里发现明确的选项与倾向时，会在这里提出草稿。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When AI finds clear options and a leaning in your sources, it drafts a decision here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 建议，接受后保留，忽略后不再出现。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suggested by AI. Accept to keep it, or ignore to hide it for good."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 总结": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI summary"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 整理，可能有误；原文以上方内容为准。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Organized by AI and may contain mistakes. The original above is authoritative."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 整理，可能有误；点 [n] 查看依据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Organized by AI and may contain mistakes. Tap [n] to see the source."
          }
        }
      }
    },
