    "今天的 AI 用量已达上限，明天再试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's AI usage limit is reached. Try again tomorrow."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天的手动回顾次数已用完，明天再试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've used today's manual reviews. Try again tomorrow."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天的提问次数已用完，明天再试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've used today's questions. Try again tomorrow."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天的记录数已达上限，记录已保留在本机，明天会自动上传。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's entry limit is reached. The entry is kept on this device and will upload tomorrow."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你保存的想法、链接正文和截图文字会存放在海外/港澳的 Gatherloom 服务器上，并发送给阿里云百炼（通义千问）和 DeepSeek，用于生成摘要、建立检索、回答问题和写总结与回顾。截图图片本身不会发送给模型服务。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The thoughts, link text, and screenshot text you save are stored on Gatherloom servers outside mainland China and sent to Alibaba Cloud Bailian (Qwen) and DeepSeek to create summaries, build search, answer questions, and write summaries and reviews. Screenshot images themselves are not sent to model services."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你在做什么？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What are you working on?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
