    "删除记录": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete entry"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除资料后，它会立即从搜索和问答中移除，几分钟内从服务器清除；备份会保留最多 14 天，从备份恢复时会再次执行删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you delete a source, it's removed from search and answers right away and cleared from the server within minutes. Backups keep it for up to 14 days, and the deletion is applied again if a backup is restored."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除这条记录？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
